      "value": "I had this last night with Build `1936`. The action menu \"Close Chatbox\" and \"New Message\" did nothing, and pressing \"T\" on the keyboard also didn't do anything. In desktop mode on Windows (Steam).\n\nI don't know how to reproduce this. My client was idle for a very long time.\n\nRestarting the client resolved the issue.",
